---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import aboutPortrait from '../assets/about/matthew-campfire-portrait.png';
---

<section id="about" class="about section-block" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="about__grid">
			<div class="about__content">
				<div class="heading-block">
					<p class="text-accent section-label">Beyond the browser</p>
					<h2 id="about-heading">I started in design. I stayed for the build.</h2>
				</div>

				<div class="about__body">
					<p>
						I care about the details that make something feel intentional: typography,
						layout, and how a person actually moves through an interface.
					</p>
					<p>
						I started in visual design and digital experiences, then followed the work
						into the code. What began as wanting to understand how my designs were built
						became Shopify, Liquid, JavaScript, CSS, accessibility, and a shared theme.
						Today I manage that theme for hundreds of storefronts, so a layout, a fix,
						or an update can land once and still feel like it belongs to each business.
					</p>
					<p>
						When I'm not working, I'm usually outside: camping, fishing, sitting by a fire,
						or keeping up with the Lakers. Getting away from a screen is how I come back
						to the work with a clearer eye.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="about__media">
				<Image
					class="about__portrait"
					src={aboutPortrait}
					alt="Matthew smiling in a cap sitting in a folding chair holding a drink beside a glowing campfire in a green park, creating a relaxed mood."
					widths={[320, 448, 640]}
					sizes="(min-width: 64rem) 28rem, min(100vw - 2.5rem, 28rem)"
				/>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.about__grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		gap: var(--space-xl);
	}

	@media (min-width: 64rem) {
		.about__grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1.35fr 1fr;
			gap: var(--space-lg);
			align-items: center;
		}
	}

	.about__content {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: var(--space-md);
	}

	.about__body {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: var(--space-md);
	}

	.about__media {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
	}

	.about__portrait {
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 28rem;
		height: auto;
		aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
		object-fit: cover;
		border-radius: var(--radius-md);
		background-color: var(--color-surface-muted);
	}
</style>
